    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76317" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀψίζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀψέ</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>do, go</i>, or <i>come
				late</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.5.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>HG</u>
				6.5.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lyc.</u>
				12
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀψίζεσθαι ἐν ταῖς ὁδοῖς</span>
