				<u>Lac.</u>
				6.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠψίσθημεν τῆς ἀναγωγῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					5.22
				</span></i>
			.</div>
